  "description": "XAMSEM crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group F d d d. Reported CIF formula moiety: C112 H112 Dy8 N48 O24,16(H2 O1),2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy2 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.754-3.754 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.07-112.69°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy8L6(μ2-OH)4(H2O)4(N3)4(CH3O)4]·16H2O·2CH3OH (empirical C114H108Dy8N48O42). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
